  "location": "CRE32.63 (cross-ref to CRE20.92)",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: CRE32.63 (cross-ref to CRE20.92)",
      "summary": "CRE32.63 refers to CRE20.92 for 100% CCF items, but CRE20.92 is the currency-mismatch multiplier and the 100% CCF list is in CRE20.95.",
      "impact": "Position: Retail undrawn commitment 100 that is a 100%-CCF item (CRE20.95), PD 1%, bank has approved own EAD estimates; own EAD estimate 40. Reading a: Follow CRE20.92 literally: it contains no CCF, so the 100% exclusion never triggers and own EAD 40 is allowed -> EAD 40. Reading b: Follow CRE20.95: item is at 100% CCF in the SA, so own estimates are not allowed -> EAD 100. Difference: EAD 60 (RWA scales proportionally)",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
